ng from objects using your own two hands. It takes split-second timing to master, but once you get the hang of it, you'll be flying through maps like a pro.", "short_description": "This is the app published by the owner and developer of Terra Tag. Bringing a massive game developer\u2019s vision back to VR, this isn\u2019t just an update\u2014it's Terra Tag Reborn. Experience all-new features and the original intensity. Get ready to swing, jump, and tag like never before in Echo Tag Reborn!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/echo-tag-reborn-privacy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RVX/AIDENVR/GORILLASTUDIOS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/websiteforechotagreborn/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1211528922043777"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1584107799968448_7860675481920524270_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ebp0Mli8y_YQ7kNvwGQ59-P&_nc_oc=Adpv2a3B2NwJNzFRafBLJO7BrFykTLF4Hxf6b4jTvMcwWnTQTwELz6OEpcZ0dWE5F1w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKj9WU-FIy9vt5Qnoet1pZKsXRS8B-Jnnea81kfg33TAg&oe=6AA16FF4"}, "is_concept": false, "is_tes